instance variable vs static variable:
__________________________________________________
-instance variable:every object separate memory created
-static variables only one copy of memory created that can be
 shared by all objects

 -once we do the modifications on instance variable it will reflect on specific object
 -once we do the modifications on static variable it will reflect on all objects

